          "body": "**Story:** As a user every brick already carries a `tooltipText` that is stored, exported and\nimported, but nothing ever shows it to me, and I want to hover a brick and find out what it does.\n\n**Objective**\n\n- Render `model.tooltipText` as a tooltip on the brick's outline in\n  [`src/components/Brick/BrickFixed.tsx`](../src/components/Brick/BrickFixed.tsx) and\n  [`src/components/Brick/BrickInput.tsx`](../src/components/Brick/BrickInput.tsx).\n- Use a delay so it does not fire during a drag, and hide it while a drag is in flight.\n- Expose the same text through an accessible name on the brick, so it is not pointer only.",
